Pengurus.

19:42.230 --> 19:42.860
Pengurus!

19:43.160 --> 19:44.400
Tunggu aku, Pengurus!

19:44.400 --> 19:45.660
Tunggu aku, Pengurus!

19:54.830 --> 19:56.280
