26:18.960 --> 26:19.400
Baik.

26:22.020 --> 26:23.230
Penjarakan mereka!

26:45.710 --> 26:47.310
Tuan Prajurit, ampuni kami.

26:48.810 --> 26:49.460
Ampun.

26:52.700 --> 26:53.370
Masuk.

27:10.440 --> 27:10.960
Kak?

27:11.680 --> 27:12.280
Bos.

27:13.770 --> 27:15.030
Kebetulan sekali, ya.

27:17.190 --> 27:18.660
Bagaimana kalian bisa masuk ke sini?

27:18.660 --> 27:19.810
Aku... kami...

27:20.640 --> 27:23.100
